  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Applied Research Institute Jeru</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Applied Research Institute Jerusalem - ARIJ implements a number of initiatives in the fields of social accountability citizens participation and budget monitoring with the local authorities across OPT. ARIJ governance team works systematically with local civil societies to improve the accountability of key local authorities and help local state institutions in becoming more responsive to community needs. In relation to community participation ARIJ good governance team works to provide and develop thecapacities of local and national authorities with the required support to create more sustainable communities by applying an integrated and participatory approach to local policy making.  In addition, ARIJ also works with civil society organizations on integrating good governance practices in the work of local CBOs and NGOs</narrative>
  </participating-org>
